{"id":"n84870-2-6","stage":2,"title":"폭발 · 爆发","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84870-2-6-1","ko":"생일에 선물을 이렇게 많이 받다니! 너 완전히 인기 폭발이구나?","zh":"生日能收到这么多礼物！你简直人气爆棚啊！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"생일에","meaning":"生日，生辰","explanation":"생일：生日，生辰；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"생일","audio":"/audio/a2b4cce280c34b80d474.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63220","senseId":"1","lemma":"생일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생일에","audio":"/audio/9c7d54d293f22dc53320.mp3"}},{"text":"선물을","meaning":"礼物","explanation":"선물：礼物；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36685","senseId":"1","lemma":"선물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선물을","audio":"/audio/9f3490a05172f0786ee4.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"받다니!","meaning":"收到、得到（礼物）","explanation":"받다：收到、得到（礼物）；다니：对听到的内容表示惊讶、感叹或反问。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받다니","audio":"/audio/b45ae6456eb9397462d3.mp3"}},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"완전히","meaning":"完全地，完美地，彻底地","explanation":"완전히：完全地，完美地，彻底地","readings":[{"term":"완전히","audio":"/audio/b38cc705c97aaddc4849.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67847","senseId":"1","lemma":"완전히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"완전히","audio":"/audio/b38cc705c97aaddc4849.mp3"}},{"text":"인기","meaning":"人气","explanation":"인기：人气","readings":[{"term":"인기","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70758","senseId":"1","lemma":"인기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인기","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3"}},{"text":"폭발이구나?","meaning":"爆发","explanation":"폭발：爆发；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"폭발","audio":"/audio/b40c5ca9058feed4b2a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84870","senseId":"2","lemma":"폭발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"폭발이구나","audio":"/audio/07c80b0045d46655e671.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a2b4cce280c34b80","term":"생일","zh":"生日，生辰","audio":"/audio/a2b4cce280c34b80d474.mp3","entryId":"63220","definition":"人出生的日子。","pronunciation":["생일"]},{"id":"807cae1b57085769","term":"선물","zh":"礼物","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3","entryId":"36685","definition":"为表达谢意或祝贺某事而把东西送给别人；或指该东西。","pronunciation":["선ː물"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收到、得到（礼物）","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"收到、得到（礼物）","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"b38cc705c97aaddc","term":"완전히","zh":"完全地，完美地，彻底地","audio":"/audio/b38cc705c97aaddc4849.mp3","entryId":"67847","definition":"没有不足之处，具备完整无缺没有瑕疵地。","pronunciation":["완전히"]},{"id":"97bd6aed2c720b21","term":"인기","zh":"人气","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3","entryId":"70758","definition":"许多人对某个对象的浓厚兴趣或喜爱之心。","pronunciation":["인끼"]},{"id":"b40c5ca9058feed4","term":"폭발","zh":"爆发","audio":"/audio/b40c5ca9058feed4b2a3.mp3","entryId":"84870","definition":"力量或热情等突然扩散或产生。","pronunciation":["폭빨"]}],"audio":"/audio/40e2e7522988a67837e2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84870-2-6-2","ko":"부끄럽게 그런 말 마.","zh":"别这么说，会让人不好意思的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"부끄럽게","meaning":"害羞，羞涩，腼腆","explanation":"부끄럽다：害羞，羞涩，腼腆；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"부끄럽다","audio":"/audio/3109572de7c050e1c422.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60125","senseId":"1","lemma":"부끄럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부끄럽게","audio":"/audio/0109ba46a1bf326de1a4.mp3"}},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}},{"text":"말","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}},{"text":"마.","meaning":"不做","explanation":"말다：不做；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마","audio":"/audio/0a8a81fee098641dbae5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3109572de7c050e1","term":"부끄럽다","zh":"害羞，羞涩，腼腆","audio":"/audio/3109572de7c050e1c422.mp3","entryId":"60125","definition":"感到不好意思或难为情。","pronunciation":["부끄럽따"]},{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不做","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不做某事；或指不是。","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/36ab9f7379a27f1a2187.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.372,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84870","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":79,"sequenceScore":2.1987,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["别这么说，会让人不好意思的。","这次欧盟会议的议题是什么？","生日能收到这么多礼物！你简直人气爆棚啊！"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["别这么说，会让人不好意思的。","生日能收到这么多礼物！你简直人气爆棚啊！","这次欧盟会议的议题是什么？"],"answer":0}]}
